# Optional. Live mode only. Never commit a real key.
# OpenAI geo-blocks api.openai.com from mainland China and some other networks.
# The scored path does not need this variable: pnpm demo:mock
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
#
# Knobs below are optional. Leave them unset for the judge path.
# FORGEFLOW_HITL=deny rejects a draft that already passed the rubric (exit 1).
# FORGEFLOW_MAX_REPAIRS must be an integer from 0 to 4. Default 2.
# FORGEFLOW_MODE=live applies only when `tsx src/cli.ts demo` omits --mode.
# pnpm demo:mock always passes --mode mock.
